  "details": "This would help people when taking pictures for their avatar when uploading to VRC as it will allow people to store a render buffer for any given frame that looks best. This is helpful for people who have avatars with a lot of motion on idle. Also being able to input an image directly into the VRC  Cam is so much better for several reasons. \n1 - It allows for less cropping issues.\n\n2 - It makes it so much less of a hassle for me to put my pretty renders I made for my avatar in frame\n\n3 - Inputting an image directly negates having to set any sort of shader to Unlit. (Which usually takes a lot of scrolling if you have a lot of shaders.)",
